{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"16f868cef2f7c816","type":"text","text":"Themes and our ideas","x":865,"y":-355,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"817888fee0127a79","type":"text","text":"Chiel's idea:\nopen world with if if we find a composer or if we are not capable of it ambient noises (no music, only sound effects). because i think the theme will be night i want to do it in white and a\nblue-ish black. my aim is to a zelda type game, otherwise a non combat open world (yume nikki(again), animal crossing, stardew valley, etc.).","x":865,"y":-248,"width":250,"height":380},
		{"id":"643c2954c8cd41c5","type":"text","text":"i want to make the game based on the echo flower area in undertale","x":560,"y":88,"width":250,"height":88},
		{"id":"2b0871d69a4c06e3","x":1250,"y":322,"width":400,"height":298,"type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260731133401.png"},
		{"id":"b40b4b5de5a86e87","x":1360,"y":69,"width":250,"height":126,"type":"text","text":"the hotlands were also a cool thing to talk about to make a little platforming section in the game"},
		{"id":"641bcfa05f25a205","type":"text","text":"skibidean","x":-109,"y":-58,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"fc63d8712dc5d784","type":"text","text":"we are going to use orchestrator","x":260,"y":-580,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"af8ef0865f08b076","type":"text","text":"link:\n[https://github.com/CraterCrash/godot-orchestrator](https://github.com/CraterCrash/godot-orchestrator \"https://github.com/CraterCrash/godot-orchestrator\")","x":310,"y":-393,"width":250,"height":98},
